                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-key me-2"></i>Key Takeaway</h5>
                        <ul class="mb-0">
                            <li>Static members belong to the class, not instances</li>
                            <li>Instance members belong to each object</li>
                            <li>Use static for utility methods and shared data</li>
                            <li>Use instance for object-specific data and behavior</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
